<title>USA: MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange Grain reported the following deliveries against September futures (wheat in 000 bu, shrimp in lots) -</p>
<p>SPRING WHEAT - 660. Oldest long - Sept 9, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered Duluth/Superior 660,000 bu.</p>
<p>Delivered - LFG/c 660.</p>
<p>Received - Atwood Commodities/h 660.</p>
<p>WHITE WHEAT - 130. Oldest long - Sept 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - Country Hedging/h 130.</p>
<p>Received - Country Hedging/c 60, LFG/c 70.</p>
<p>BLACK TIGER SHRIMP - Nil. Oldest long - Aug 13, 1996.</p>
<p>BARLEY - Nil. Oldest long - Aug 2, 1996.</p>
<p>WHITE SHRIMP - Nil.</p>
<p>H=House. C=Customer account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
